UV Orientation Controls

    Flip U (Horizontal): Mirrors logos left/right on texture
    Flip V (Vertical): Mirrors logos up/down on texture
    Swap U/V: Swaps U and V coordinates
    Save UV Settings: Saves current settings for the loaded model
    Reset UV Settings: Resets to default values
    Test UV Orientation: Shows where UV corners map to on the model
    
How to Use:
    Load your model as usual
    Place a test logo somewhere on the model
    Export to see where it appears on the texture
    Adjust UV Orientation controls until logos appear in the correct location:
        If logo appears on the opposite side horizontally → Toggle "Flip U"
        If logo appears on the opposite side vertically → Toggle "Flip V"
        If logo appears in completely wrong area → Try "Swap U/V"
    Click "Save UV Settings" to remember these settings for this model
    Future sessions will automatically load these settings
    
    
    Test Combinations (try in this order):
Combination	Flip U	Flip V	Swap UV	    Expected Result
1	        OFF	    OFF	    OFF	        Original placement
2	        OFF	    OFF	    ON	        Moved diagonally
3	        ON	    OFF	    ON	        Moved diagonally + flipped horizontally
4	        OFF	    ON	    ON	        Moved diagonally + flipped vertically
5	        ON	    ON	    ON	        Moved diagonally + flipped both